{"date":"2025-03-31","title":"Spring Forward","url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1795283637962152","kind":"content","body":[{"p":"New weekly care package drop collections, Spring cleaning on Inferno and Train, and an update to content in the Armory—today's update contains a little something for everyone!"},{"h":"New Drop Collections"},{"p":"Your weekly care packages just got a bit more interesting. Three new weapon collections have been added to the care package drop list, so keep an eye out for items from the all-new Ascent, Boreal, and Radiant collections. With over 70 new finishes, these collections feature a wide range of styles from solid colors, gold reliefs, camo patterns, custom paint jobs and more."},{"img":"https://clan.cloudflare.steamstatic.com/images/3381077/601d33cc08e6cdff60dd5e06607c93abaab4df8a.png"},{"img":"https://clan.cloudflare.steamstatic.com/images/3381077/03db35cc824943a55ab73415c613d6fe91853b4b.png"},{"img":"https://clan.cloudflare.steamstatic.com/images/3381077/16ce891176919f3728f08b206dc33f1ad702132a.png"},{"h":"Spring cleaning on Inferno and Train"},{"p":"We're also tidying up a few maps. Inferno and Train have undergone some Spring cleaning. You'll notice cleaner surfaces, less clutter, and a slightly wider banana."},{"img":"https://clan.cloudflare.steamstatic.com/images/3381077/b55c104f0c2cc312b2e6eb83c5811634910b8699.png"},{"h":"New additions to the Armory"},{"p":"The Armory has received some new offerings, beginning with the all-new Fever Case, featuring 17 weapon finishes from community contributors and Shattered Web knives in Chroma finishes:"},{"p":"[carousel]"},{"img":"https://clan.cloudflare.steamstatic.com/images/3381077/5892c4382bfbd600565554a20bcabfaf307a3606.png"},{"img":"https://clan.cloudflare.steamstatic.com/images/3381077/faaac749ffac30ccd49f986dcf7ed442c2221f6e.png"},{"img":"https://clan.cloudflare.steamstatic.com/images/3381077/d25f69a427f516ae8ec702b4f611d313e8e6ef72.png"},{"img":"https://clan.cloudflare.steamstatic.com/images/3381077/d755a62e06da8b5e91d5dfa182cdbf2658096bf9.png"},{"img":"https://clan.cloudflare.steamstatic.com/images/3381077/a475832075ba1b2a30ce66b85afc280cd5f614f1.png"},{"img":"https://clan.cloudflare.steamstatic.com/images/3381077/a54176a219c0de9e779e7136248c05272ca2b39b.png"},{"img":"https://clan.cloudflare.steamstatic.com/images/3381077/85a164a3f63326e849ed6d02d57e299782c14cdc.png"},{"img":"https://clan.cloudflare.steamstatic.com/images/3381077/97a0893495957dd7fafe103c54c587b28eb64798.png"},{"img":"https://clan.cloudflare.steamstatic.com/images/3381077/a681b6dcfe7a50adee9d45234575c0eabea56e86.png"},{"img":"https://clan.cloudflare.steamstatic.com/images/3381077/5f7c18a627e1f8de5b9aa6ef2708febc11bdabc9.png"},{"img":"https://clan.cloudflare.steamstatic.com/images/3381077/00ace9af5a5f4bf3288bede5207044aa749b5d1c.png"},{"img":"https://clan.cloudflare.steamstatic.com/images/3381077/a6b19d825b6e1ac7bbacfb64fb57bd8a066f6efb.png"},{"img":"https://clan.cloudflare.steamstatic.com/images/3381077/02814b4b4aeb224edadc70a47e43b6743eff25ba.png"},{"img":"https://clan.cloudflare.steamstatic.com/images/3381077/a9e411ad6b1947766c518aa7c2c35fcad77138c1.png"},{"img":"https://clan.cloudflare.steamstatic.com/images/3381077/c0df9c31d99904477d896f8d6447c16594abc983.png"},{"img":"https://clan.cloudflare.steamstatic.com/images/3381077/14a7e8d3ffffb7de74aaf84ebf6cffb12ea5647a.png"},{"img":"https://clan.cloudflare.steamstatic.com/images/3381077/1862f0b14868b1a37e7993cf479eb75c7889f2a5.png"},{"img":"https://clan.cloudflare.steamstatic.com/images/3381077/42f5fe8fc0c74e51b36a94e766b55d7d8d399c9a.png"},{"p":"[/carousel]"},{"p":"And with Train releasing earlier this year, its collection gets a revamp featuring designs inspired by the map's graffiti, location, and more:"},{"p":"[carousel]"},{"img":"https://clan.cloudflare.steamstatic.com/images/3381077/5a41ddeb23099b24764e09e3bbbc82adeb9d8d7c.png"},{"img":"https://clan.cloudflare.steamstatic.com/images/3381077/364c260727b7c9cfd1cb8b3254674711c5b6de75.png"},{"img":"https://clan.cloudflare.steamstatic.com/images/3381077/7edeee04a993875ed12eaa0544dcae90a0155139.png"},{"img":"https://clan.cloudflare.steamstatic.com/images/3381077/911b13881d223108837ede7ac38907ecca90f8bc.png"},{"img":"https://clan.cloudflare.steamstatic.com/images/3381077/7693e86d83bd261a4a064a941e2f3ca11e145fd4.png"},{"img":"https://clan.cloudflare.steamstatic.com/images/3381077/a09af00fc828ac02ddcee1f3bde5c2cd2747f26e.png"},{"img":"https://clan.cloudflare.steamstatic.com/images/3381077/2335fb1bf916d91856c0168b6de0f7019d7310a5.png"},{"img":"https://clan.cloudflare.steamstatic.com/images/3381077/fce6b97de8322657c2a8af4a83a044ac49370d03.png"},{"img":"https://clan.cloudflare.steamstatic.com/images/3381077/a848d5223d2b41fd66f07970928dd505677e2618.png"},{"img":"https://clan.cloudflare.steamstatic.com/images/3381077/c3236fd81c27b2703b1f5e0cb69d5ed1931bb3eb.png"},{"img":"https://clan.cloudflare.steamstatic.com/images/3381077/6875ba48b2e4e761dfbb90898cd4a3924537a636.png"},{"img":"https://clan.cloudflare.steamstatic.com/images/3381077/ffd6a06e5c3d55325c574ec6df96a205a15d2b92.png"},{"img":"https://clan.cloudflare.steamstatic.com/images/3381077/f3256e0de94bb81bbfa34be3524e06cad5cbbb85.png"},{"img":"https://clan.cloudflare.steamstatic.com/images/3381077/9af0a12693e96b9ff8601c2cf85432336afa4e73.png"},{"img":"https://clan.cloudflare.steamstatic.com/images/3381077/1f06b3028364f8826e3d9e2dddd4a357e07aa2af.png"},{"img":"https://clan.cloudflare.steamstatic.com/images/3381077/1b1475be64b0ec40fe5a7e4c4675722ec69ce933.png"},{"p":"[/carousel]"},{"p":"And one more thing, we have added a new Limited Edition Item: the XM1014 | Solitude. Its mountainous pattern comes in a wide range of variations:"},{"p":"What are you waiting for? Jump into a match and check out what's new!"}],"refs":[{"kind":"map","name":"Inferno"},{"kind":"map","name":"Train"},{"kind":"case","name":"Fever Case","slug":"fever-case","img":"fever-case"},{"kind":"weapon","name":"XM1014"}],"slug":"spring-forward"}